sequenceDiagram
    %% llm-d-batch-gateway-operator — data flows
    autonumber
    actor User as User / ai-gateway tooling
    participant API as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Op as Operator manager<br/>SA llm-d-batch-gateway-operator
    participant Helm as Helm engine<br/>in-process
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>redhat-ods-monitoring
    participant GW as Platform Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant APISrv as cr-apiserver<br/>8000/TCP HTTP or HTTPS
    participant Proc as Processor / GC
    participant Store as PostgreSQL 5432 / S3 443
    participant Queue as Redis 6379 or PG queue
    participant Async as Async processor
    participant IGW as Inference gateway / EPP

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
    Note over User,Helm: Flow 1 - LLMBatchGateway reconciliation
    User->>API: create LLMBatchGateway<br/>User token + RBAC (aggregated admin/edit)
    API-->>Op: watch event (SA token)
    Op->>API: list ReferenceGrants, get source Secret
    Op->>API: SSA cr-credentials Secret (cross-namespace only)
    Op->>Helm: render batch-gateway + llm-d-async charts
    Helm-->>Op: unstructured objects (no Helm releases)
    Op->>API: SSA Deployments, StatefulSet, Services, ConfigMaps,<br/>SAs, Roles, RoleBindings, optional HTTPRoute/Certificate/monitors<br/>field owner llmbatchgateway-controller
    Op->>API: list owned objects in managedGVKs, delete orphans
    Op->>API: patch status (Ready, APIServerAvailable, ...)
    end

    rect rgb(235, 255, 235)
    Note over GW,IGW: Flow 2 - Batch request path (operands)
    User->>GW: POST /v1/batches, /v1/files<br/>HTTPS TLS, gateway-level auth (e.g. MaaS)
    GW->>APISrv: HTTPRoute backend 8000/TCP<br/>TLS if spec.tls.enabled, tenant headers
    APISrv->>Store: job metadata + files<br/>credentials from secretRef
    Proc->>Store: read inputs, write results
    Proc->>Queue: enqueue requests<br/>redis-url / postgresql-url
    Async->>Queue: dequeue requests
    Async->>IGW: inference request<br/>optional TLS/mTLS, inference API key<br/>insecureSkipVerify possible
    IGW-->>Async: inference response
    Async->>Queue: results
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 225)
    Note over Prom,Op: Flow 3 - Operator metrics scrape
    Prom->>Op: GET /metrics 8443/TCP HTTPS<br/>service-ca TLS, Bearer SA token
    Op->>API: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview
    API-->>Op: allowed
    Op-->>Prom: metrics
    end
